:: The Danish Royal Ballpit [castle]

A large room with a high vaulted ceiling is filled kneedepth with colourful plastic balls.

<<character "Fukuyama">> is here. He is pushing a large squishy globe twice his height up a ramp. The globe is decorated with a map of the world. It is in a cartoonish style, but quite cartographically precise. The ramp narrows near the top, making the globe wobble unsteadily. As you watch, he and the globe tumble back into the ballpit.

At the top of the ramp is a cake.

[[There is a tiny wooden door->Tiny Chapel Door]]
